{"id":"bea77fab814b3292","group":"58","path":"58/batch13/58-df-ordered-pair.md","title":"Ordered Pair","display":"df-ordered-pair — Ordered Pair","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-ordered-pair","aliases":["58-df-ordered-pair"],"display":"df-ordered-pair — Ordered Pair","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-ax-pair.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-set.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-ordered-pair"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-ordered-pair</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-ordered-pair — Ordered Pair"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b427958ee01d782e\" href=\"?note=b427958ee01d782e\" title=\"../batch16/58-ax-pair.md\">../batch16/58-ax-pair.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"65d9a1e690c32aad\" href=\"?note=65d9a1e690c32aad\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-set.md\">../batch12/58-df-set.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in V\">\\(a\\in V\\)</span> (set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"65d9a1e690c32aad\" href=\"?note=65d9a1e690c32aad\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-set.md\">../batch12/58-df-set.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\\in V\">\\(b\\in V\\)</span> (set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"65d9a1e690c32aad\" href=\"?note=65d9a1e690c32aad\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-set.md\">../batch12/58-df-set.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle a,b\\rangle\">\\(\\langle a,b\\rangle\\)</span> (Kuratowski ordered pair defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ordered\\text{-}pair} \\vdash \\forall a,b\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\langle a,b\\rangle=\\{\\{a\\},\\{a,b\\}\\}\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ordered\\text{-}pair} \\vdash \\forall a,b\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\langle a,b\\rangle=\\{\\{a\\},\\{a,b\\}\\}\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The ordered-pair code satisfies <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle a,b\\rangle=\\langle c,d\\rangle\">\\(\\langle a,b\\rangle=\\langle c,d\\rangle\\)</span> iff <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a=c\">\\(a=c\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b=d\">\\(b=d\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-ax-pair.md","status":"resolved","id":"b427958ee01d782e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-ax-pair.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"65d9a1e690c32aad","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"65d9a1e690c32aad","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$a\\in V$ (set, see [[../batch12/58-df-set.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"65d9a1e690c32aad","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$b\\in V$ (set, see [[../batch12/58-df-set.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"a\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"b\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle a,b\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\tex